# Project information.
title: IronChrono
abstract: >-
  The maintained, agentic-first successor to chrono, the Rust date and time library, and a
  drop-in replacement for it. A fork of chrono (0.4.45 plus two unreleased fixes, commit
  6adaa52). Apart from Nervosys, the authors listed are the original chrono authors.
